      "note": "The Investigator starts without a task reference, on a sprint, or on a sprint and master, never on a leaf; its concern arrives in its parent's first role_message, or from the developer's request when it has no parent, and a missing concern or scope is asked for, never invented. Anchor: `role_message`",
